{"seq":10,"prev_hash":"sha256:3bebe303bbd16d480e60b1cdd4eec59e2448527d8acc907dd817e147a3a91303","ts":"2026-09-14T12:12:10.584Z","proposal_id":"20260914T120951-prd-enterprise-procurement","extraction_of":"sha256:b5d715e13168f1bcca358fd3057f8694dc4bf66521104050fd3c312a0aa6da0d","nodes":[{"cid":"sha256:da6ff8de0882d38f667375124eb76aa2963d1145b2f8ac2e319a5fd73ae3e3bb","label":"usecase","content":{"title":"Browse the enterprise product catalog","description":"A Buyer or Procurement Manager browses the account-specific catalog of hardware products, sees each product's category, image, starting price, and availability state, can branch into configuration for configurable devices or add non-configurable items directly to a quote, and is prevented from quoting end-of-life products while being shown a recommended replacement by name.","summary":"Find eligible products for a quote.","actors":["Buyer (Requester)","Procurement Manager (Approver)"],"value":"Lets enterprise purchasers discover which products their account can quote and whether they can be configured or directly added.","risk":"low","criteria":["Each product card shows product name, category, and image, where category values are Laptop, Workstation, Tablet, and Accessory.","Each product card shows a starting price using \"From $X\" for configurable products.","Availability states are In Stock, Backorder — ships in N days when stock is zero, and End of Life.","Configurable products use a Configure action for laptops and workstations, while non-configurable products use Add to Quote for accessories and tablets.","End-of-life products show a grey End of Life badge, cannot be added to a quote, and show the recommended replacement product by name."],"derived":true}}],"edges":[{"ecid":"sha256:e2094233b183d7f6bcc4eab2adfd2ef8f9f5e7588e1b3785ba747ca84ba24016","type":"DERIVES","src":"sha256:b5d715e13168f1bcca358fd3057f8694dc4bf66521104050fd3c312a0aa6da0d","dst":"sha256:6bf6b72e5150dee33ba5dbd82244c2a08760083a4e3b6bc39607624